codex
The visual sweep confirmed three concrete issues: the background was still mostly black at the decision beat’s center (the transition finished too late), the nav briefly became low-contrast during that mismatch, and CSS sticky plus GSAP pinning produced inconsistent top alignment. The grey-to-dark manifesto cut is also visibly abrupt, so I’m adding a short v5-scoped transition band on the manifesto side without changing the shiftrun’s required persistent grey.
